{
  "apiVersion": "yingce.plugin/v2",
  "id": "doubao-local-gateway",
  "name": "Doubao Local Gateway",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "影策 / 本地网关",
  "description": "本地豆包网关（127.0.0.1:9090）异步视频任务协议插件。提交走 POST /v1/video/tasks，轮询走 GET /v1/video/tasks/{id}。",
  "documentation": "# Doubao Local Gateway\n\n该插件对接本机运行的豆包 Web 网关（`doubao-web-mcp`），用于在影策画布中调用网关的视频生成能力。\n\n## 协议身份\n\n- 插件 ID：`doubao-local-gateway`\n- Provider ID：`doubao-local-gateway`\n- 能力：`video`\n- 默认 Base URL：`http://127.0.0.1:9090/v1`\n- 鉴权：`none`（网关在本机回环地址上不校验 API Key）\n- 创建：`POST /v1/video/tasks`\n- 查询：`GET /v1/video/tasks/{{taskId}}`\n\n## 与上游的字段差异\n\n网关的同步端点 `POST /v1/video/generations` 会阻塞到成片返回且不提供 task id，影策的视频协议全部是「提交 + 轮询」两阶段，因此这里对接网关新增的异步兼容层。\n\n| 统一字段 | 上游字段 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `model` | `model` | 网关档位键，例如 `seedance_v2.0`（Fast）。 |\n| `prompt` | `prompt` | 视频提示词。 |\n| `duration` | `duration` | 整数秒；网关按档位限制 4–15 秒（2.5 档到 30 秒）。 |\n| `aspectRatio` | `ratio` | 网关使用 `ratio`，取值 `auto/3:4/4:3/9:16/16:9/1:1/21:9`。 |\n| `resolution` | `resolution` | 只有 2.5 档接受 `720p`/`1080p`；其余档位传了会报错，故用 `$omitEmpty` 且不设默认值。 |\n| `images` | `images` | 参考图数组，网关接受 http(s) URL、data URI 或本机路径。 |\n| `videos` | `ref_video` | 仅 `seedance_v2.0`（Fast）开放 1 个参考视频。 |\n| `generateAudio` | `generate_audio` | 网关当前不消费该字段，保留透传。 |\n\n## 响应映射\n\n网关异步任务返回 `{id, object, status, progress, video_url, data:[{video_url,url}], message, error:{message}}`。状态取值 `queued/processing/succeeded/failed`，与影策的状态归一表一一对应。\n\n成片 URL 指向网关自身的 `/media/...`，属于临时地址，因此标记 `resultEphemeral`，由宿主立即下载持久化。\n\n## 运行前提\n\n1. 网关需以 `GATEWAY_NO_PAUSE=1` 常驻运行并监听 9090。\n2. 影策后端需放行回环地址：`CANVAS_ALLOWED_PRIVATE_UPSTREAM_HOSTS=127.0.0.1`，否则创建渠道与请求上游都会被 SSRF 防护拒绝。\n3. 网关的 `GATE_LOCK` 单账号串行，异步任务的并发由 `GATEWAY_TASK_CONCURRENCY` 控制（默认 1）。\n",
  "permissions": [
    "generation.run",
    "media.read"
  ],
  "configuration": {
    "fields": []
  },
  "contributes": {
    "providers": [
      {
        "id": "doubao-local-gateway",
        "label": "Doubao Local Gateway",
        "capabilities": [
          "video"
        ],
        "scopes": [
          "admin.system-channel",
          "user.custom-channel",
          "canvas",
          "creation",
          "agent"
        ],
        "baseUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:9090/v1",
        "requiresPublicMediaUrls": false,
        "auth": {
          "type": "none"
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "model",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "mapping": "model",
            "description": "网关视频档位键，例如 seedance_v2.0（Fast）。"
          },
          {
            "name": "prompt",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "mapping": "prompt",
            "description": "视频生成提示词。"
          },
          {
            "name": "images",
            "type": "media[]",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "images",
            "description": "参考图，支持 http(s) URL、data URI 或本机路径。"
          },
          {
            "name": "videos",
            "type": "media[]",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "ref_video",
            "description": "参考视频，仅 seedance_v2.0（Fast）开放 1 个。"
          },
          {
            "name": "audios",
            "type": "media[]",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "unsupported",
            "description": "网关当前不支持参考音频。"
          },
          {
            "name": "duration",
            "type": "integer",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "duration",
            "description": "视频时长秒数，网关按档位限制。"
          },
          {
            "name": "aspectRatio",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "ratio",
            "description": "画幅比例，网关字段名为 ratio。"
          },
          {
            "name": "resolution",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "resolution",
            "description": "分辨率档位，仅 2.5 档支持；为空时不发送。"
          },
          {
            "name": "generateAudio",
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "generate_audio",
            "description": "是否生成音频，网关当前不消费。"
          },
          {
            "name": "watermark",
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "unsupported",
            "description": "网关不提供水印开关。"
          }
        ],
        "create": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/video/tasks",
          "contentType": "application/json",
          "body": {
            "model": {
              "$ref": "request.model"
            },
            "prompt": {
              "$ref": "request.prompt"
            },
            "duration": {
              "$if": {
                "condition": {
                  "$gt": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "request.duration"
                    },
                    0
                  ]
                },
                "then": {
                  "$ref": "request.duration"
                },
                "else": 5
              }
            },
            "ratio": {
              "$coalesce": [
                {
                  "$ref": "request.aspectRatio"
                },
                "16:9"
              ]
            },
            "resolution": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$ref": "request.resolution"
              }
            },
            "images": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$map": {
                  "from": {
                    "$sortByOrder": {
                      "$ref": "request.images"
                    }
                  },
                  "as": "media",
                  "in": {
                    "$ref": "media.value"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "ref_video": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$first": {
                  "$map": {
                    "from": {
                      "$sortByOrder": {
                        "$ref": "request.videos"
                      }
                    },
                    "as": "media",
                    "in": {
                      "$ref": "media.value"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "poll": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/video/tasks/{{taskId}}"
        },
        "response": {
          "taskId": {
            "$coalesce": [
              {
                "$ref": "response.id"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.task_id"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.data.id"
              }
            ]
          },
          "status": {
            "$coalesce": [
              {
                "$ref": "response.status"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.state"
              },
              "pending"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "$coalesce": [
              {
                "$ref": "response.error.message"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.message"
              }
            ]
          },
          "videos": {
            "$coalesce": [
              {
                "$map": {
                  "from": {
                    "$ref": "response.data"
                  },
                  "as": "item",
                  "in": {
                    "$coalesce": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "item.video_url"
                      },
                      {
                        "$ref": "item.url"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.video_url"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.url"
              }
            ]
          },
          "errorPaths": [
            "error.message"
          ],
          "resultEphemeral": true
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
